	(text "R80 keeps CSN high (radio not selected) while the Pi boots. 3V3_RADIO and the Pi's 3.3 V come up and go\ndown together (both from 5V_PI). No IRQ pull-up: the Linux HAL turns on the Pi's own pull-up on GPIO 24\n(IRQ is open drain, falling edge)."
